+# MeterKit isolated alpha
+
+Generated from an explicitly reviewed sandbox policy. Disabled by default.
+
+Set VITE_METERKIT_ALPHA_ENABLED=true and VITE_METERKIT_ALPHA_API_URL to the isolated MeterKit server origin only after owner policy approval. Visit /meterkit-alpha. Existing Command Center behavior remains the fallback. Existing Supabase sign-in is reused; no API secrets belong in the browser.
+
+Backend requires a separately approved METERKIT_ALPHA_POLICY, allowlisted workspace, verified Supabase membership/module/role, real Postgres migration, PayPal sandbox app and Gemini data approval. UI installation alone is not end-to-end payment acceptance.
+
+Run npm run build and npm test. Run MeterKit fixed Postgres contracts independently. Do not weaken tests to accept a generated patch. Never activate production billing or alter deterministic Savings calculations.
+
+Reviewed demo policy:
+```json
+{
+  "version": 1,
+  "mode": "sandbox",
+  "feature": "savings.explanation",
+  "credits": 5,
+  "packs": [
+    {
+      "id": "demo",
+      "credits": 50,
+      "amountMinor": 100,
+      "currency": "USD"
+    }
+  ]
+}
+```
